{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 38,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.11469268798828,
        527.4425659179688,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "(73,23) Although some studies suggest otherwise  , the GDG maintained the past position that people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3705444335938,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "with HIV who have a positive test for TBI benefit more from TPT than those who have a negative TBI",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        92.51471710205078,
        527.3908081054688,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(17,26) test  . TBI testing can be used, where feasible, to identify such individuals. The GDG, however,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.1404418945312,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "based on evidence of moderate certainty, strongly emphasized that TBI testing by TST or IGRA should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975974082946777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.3749389648438,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "not be a prerequisite for starting TPT in people with HIV and in household contacts aged < 5 years,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.39076232910156,
        527.390380859375,
        147.83375549316406
      ],
      "text": "particularly in settings with a high TB incidence (e.g. > 100 TB cases/100 000 population), given that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.5907745361328,
        527.437744140625,
        161.0337677001953
      ],
      "text": "the benefits clearly outweigh the risks. A negative TBI test in these two groups or in HIV-negative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.18896484375,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "infant household contacts should be followed by a case-by-case assessment for the potential benefit",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994698524475098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        148.46029663085938,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "and harm of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        193.41859436035156,
        527.42578125,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis recommendation 18  In 2022, WHO issued  on use of new   antigen-based skin tests",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.6186065673828,
        527.5582885742188,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "(14) (TBSTs) to test for TBI  . A systematic review of published and unpublished data was conducted for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.997149467468262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4802856445312,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "new TBSTs based on specific antigens (ESAT-6 and CFP-10), which combine the advantage of a simpler",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.958672523498535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.3958129882812,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "skin test with the specificity of IGRAs. In all tests, antigen is injected intradermally, and, as in the TST,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.3898315429688,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "the tests are read after 48–72 h as induration in millimetres, by the method suggested by Mantoux.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.3821411132812,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "In 2022, the WHO GDG concluded that the available evidence showed that the diagnostic accuracy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.61859130859375,
        527.42431640625,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "(14) of TBSTs is similar to that of IGRAs and greater than that of the TST  . TBSTs are recommended for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.41455078125,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "all subpopulations, including people with HIV, children and adolescents and people who have been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.29473876953125,
        338.4290466308594,
        314.7377624511719
      ],
      "text": "vaccinated with the bacille Calmette-Guérin (BCG) vaccine.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        325.16131591796875,
        269.74224853515625,
        343.43133544921875
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.13720703125,
        527.3784790039062,
        364.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "TBI testing is desirable whenever feasible to identify people at highest risk for developing TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.33721923828125,
        527.395751953125,
        377.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "It is not required for people with HIV or in household contacts aged < 5 years. In HIV-negative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.5372314453125,
        527.4485473632812,
        390.9802551269531
      ],
      "text": "household contacts aged ≥ 5 years and in other risk groups TBI tests are recommended, but their",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.7372131347656,
        338.8332824707031,
        404.1802673339844
      ],
      "text": "TPT. lack of availability should not be a barrier to providing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        411.44110107421875,
        527.2418212890625,
        425.8841247558594
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that availability and affordability could determine which TBI test is used. Other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        424.64111328125,
        527.2265625,
        439.0841369628906
      ],
      "text": "considerations include the structure of the health system, the feasibility of implementation and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        437.8412170410156,
        196.86749267578125,
        452.28424072265625
      ],
      "text": "infrastructure requirements.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        459.54510498046875,
        527.3463745117188,
        473.9881286621094
      ],
      "text": "The incremental cost-effectiveness of IGRAs and TSTs appears to be influenced mainly by their",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        472.7451171875,
        527.4078979492188,
        487.1881408691406
      ],
      "text": "accuracy. BCG vaccination decisively reduces the specificity of TST. The GDG noted, however, that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        485.94512939453125,
        527.4036865234375,
        500.3881530761719
      ],
      "text": "the effect of BCG vaccination on the specificity of TST depends on the strain of vaccine used, the age",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        499.1451416015625,
        527.4542846679688,
        513.588134765625
      ],
      "text": "at which the vaccine is given and the number of doses administered. When BCG is given at birth, as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        512.3451538085938,
        527.4444580078125,
        526.7881469726562
      ],
      "text": "recommended by WHO and in practice in most parts of the world, it has a variable, limited impact",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        524.2691040039062,
        527.4215698242188,
        539.9881591796875
      ],
      "text": "(74) . Therefore, the GDG agreed that a history of BCG vaccination has a limited  on TST specificity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        538.7451171875,
        527.3936767578125,
        553.1881103515625
      ],
      "text": "effect on interpretation of TST results later in life. Hence, BCG vaccination should not be a determining",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973668098449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.945068359375,
        181.8009033203125,
        566.3880615234375
      ],
      "text": "factor in selecting a test.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.6490478515625,
        527.0943603515625,
        588.092041015625
      ],
      "text": "IGRA testing is more costly than TST and requires appropriate laboratory services. Operational difficulties",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.8489990234375,
        527.44873046875,
        601.2919921875
      ],
      "text": "should be considered in deciding which test to use. For example, IGRA requires a phlebotomy, which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.0490112304688,
        527.1572265625,
        614.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "can be difficult, particularly in young children; it requires laboratory infrastructure, technical expertise",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994749069213867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.2490234375,
        527.3854370117188,
        627.6920166015625
      ],
      "text": "and expensive equipment; and its sensitivity is reduced in children aged < 2 years and those with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.448974609375,
        527.4354248046875,
        640.8919677734375
      ],
      "text": "HIV. Nevertheless, only a single visit is required to conduct an IGRA test (although patients may have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.6489868164062,
        527.445556640625,
        654.0919799804688
      ],
      "text": "to make a second visit to receive the result). Skin testing with TST or TBST is less costly and can be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.8489990234375,
        527.4117431640625,
        667.2919921875
      ],
      "text": "performed in the field, but it requires a cold chain, two health-care visits and training in intradermal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.0490112304688,
        527.3937377929688,
        680.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "injection, reading and interpretation. One other practical advantage of IGRAs over TST is that they",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.2490234375,
        527.3859252929688,
        693.6920166015625
      ],
      "text": "are not susceptible to a “booster response”, which necessitates a two-step testing approach when",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.448974609375,
        283.6670837402344,
        706.8919677734375
      ],
      "text": "the reactivity to TST has waned since infection.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86605834960938,
        714.1528930664062,
        524.4000244140625,
        728.5958862304688
      ],
      "text": "In 2011, WHO recommended use of three IGRA products for testing for TBI: QIAGEN QuantiFERON-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.0770263671875,
        527.3803100585938,
        741.7960205078125
      ],
      "text": "(75) Gold, QIAGEN QuantiFERON-TB Gold In-Tube and Oxford Immunotec T-SPOT.TB assays  . In 2021,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.97512149810791,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.552978515625,
        527.1375122070312,
        754.9959716796875
      ],
      "text": "the list of WHO-recommended IGRAs was extended to include Beijing Wantai’s TB-IGRA and QIAGEN",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982135772705078,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        752.4769287109375,
        222.6468048095703,
        768.1959228515625
      ],
      "text": "(76) QuantiFERON-TB Gold Plus  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23321533203125,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "20 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43409729003906,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.05807495117188,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06536865234375,
        801.0170288085938,
        390.6751403808594,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: tuberculosis preventive treatment, second edition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}